sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User<br/>(kubectl / Dashboard)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as odh-notebook-controller<br/>Mutating Webhook<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ODHCtrl as odh-notebook-controller<br/>Reconciler
    participant KFCtrl as odh-kf-notebook-controller<br/>Reconciler
    participant Gateway as data-science-gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>Sidecar 8443/TCP
    participant Notebook as Notebook Pod<br/>Jupyter 8888/TCP
    participant CullingCtrl as Culling Controller

    Note over User,Notebook: Flow 1: Notebook Creation and Ingress Setup

    User->>K8sAPI: POST Notebook CR<br/>Auth: User credentials
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission Review<br/>TLS 1.2+ / API server mTLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated Notebook<br/>(kube-rbac-proxy injected,<br/>CA bundles, proxy env,<br/>ImageStream resolution)

    K8sAPI-->>ODHCtrl: Watch event: Notebook created

    par ODH Controller reconciles platform resources
        ODHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute<br/>(in central namespace)<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
        ODHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ReferenceGrant<br/>(in user namespace)<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
        ODHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicies<br/>(ctrl-np + kube-rbac-proxy-np)<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
        ODHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create kube-rbac-proxy<br/>Service + ConfigMap + CRB<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    end

    K8sAPI-->>KFCtrl: Watch event: Notebook created

    par KF Controller reconciles core resources
        KFCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create StatefulSet<br/>(1 pod per notebook)<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
        KFCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ClusterIP Service<br/>(80 → 8888/TCP)<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    end

    Note over User,Notebook: Flow 2: Notebook Access via Gateway API

    User->>Gateway: GET /notebook/{ns}/{name}<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP TLS 1.2+
    Gateway->>KRBP: Forward request<br/>HTTPS 8443/TCP TLS 1.2+
    KRBP->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(get notebooks in {ns})<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP
    K8sAPI-->>KRBP: Access granted
    KRBP->>Notebook: Proxy request<br/>HTTP 8888/TCP (localhost)<br/>X-Auth-Request-User header
    Notebook-->>KRBP: Jupyter response
    KRBP-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>User: Notebook UI

    Note over User,Notebook: Flow 3: Idle Notebook Culling

    loop Every IDLENESS_CHECK_PERIOD minutes
        CullingCtrl->>Notebook: GET /api/kernels<br/>HTTP 8888/TCP (in-cluster)
        Notebook-->>CullingCtrl: Kernel list + last_activity
        CullingCtrl->>Notebook: GET /api/terminals<br/>HTTP 8888/TCP (in-cluster)
        Notebook-->>CullingCtrl: Terminal list + last_activity
        alt Idle > CULL_IDLE_TIME
            CullingCtrl->>K8sAPI: Patch Notebook annotation<br/>(kubeflow-resource-stopped)<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP / SA token
            Note over CullingCtrl,Notebook: Notebook scaled to zero
        end
    end
